# Keep the Docker build context small and clean (the Dockerfile only needs src/ + .editorconfig).
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
.git/
.github/
documentation/
*.md
.env

# The client's dependency tree (gh#646). Tens of thousands of files that the image builds from the lockfile
# anyway -- leaving them in the context makes every image build crawl for no benefit.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
